    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ride a hotdog-selling shrimp through a surreal and perilous island in this punishing 3D platformer with a twisted sense of humor.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br><strong>Wake up, soldier!</strong><br>You play as the lone survivor of Operation Crustacean, who got stranded in a secret world. Explore a dark and gloomy island filled with danger and unravel its mysteries to find a way back home. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/85d4699921b225d51275f0719b75b3f5.poster.avif?t=1715021156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/85d4699921b225d51275f0719b75b3f5.webm?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/85d4699921b225d51275f0719b75b3f5.mp4?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br>Challenge yourself with the unique shrimp-riding controls and the game's permadeath mechanics that will require all your skill.<br>Alternate between 2 control schemes on the fly with the press of a button: &quot;Precision&quot; for accurate controls and direct, vertical movement; &quot;Gallop&quot; to go fast and far - but at a price: The increased momentum requires planning ahead.<br>Avoid deadly traps, encounter ridiculous enemies and face off against epic bosses that will push you to your limits.<br>Experience a surreal and twisted sense of humor that will make you laugh and shiver at the same time. <br>Uncover rare permanent power-ups that will give you the decisive edge when it comes to life and death.<br><br><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive and escape this bizarre island? Giddy up!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/82c4b294dae0ffa292ddaff935a66d66.poster.avif?t=1715021156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/82c4b294dae0ffa292ddaff935a66d66.webm?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/82c4b294dae0ffa292ddaff935a66d66.mp4?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGHLIGHTS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> As Indie as it gets - designed and created by a solo developer<br></li><li> Dark and atmospheric world with a twisted sense of humor.<br></li><li> Hardcore 3D platformer with unique, physics-based controls<br></li><li> Permadeath feature with few checkpoints for a challenging experience<br></li><li> Rare and precious permanent power-ups to<br></li><li> Ridiculous enemies to encounter and defeat<br></li><li> Epic bosses with unique mechanics and difficult challenges to overcome</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/6e6ff93f4a7edf8a9234a47e6159462c.poster.avif?t=1715021156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/6e6ff93f4a7edf8a9234a47e6159462c.webm?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338300/extras/6e6ff93f4a7edf8a9234a47e6159462c.mp4?t=1715021156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
